\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of aberration correction results with different methods. (a) No correction, (b) IZP with 9 Zernike terms, (c) IZP with 25 Zernike terms, and (d) superpixel aberration correction. The aberration correction is unstable especially for higher number of Zernike terms , and superpixel correction provides the best correction for our setup.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
