\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Evolution of selected Zernike coefficients across iterations during iterative Zernike perturbation over top of superpixel correction. Each subplot shows the change in coefficient values over iterations. We see improvement in the first itertation and subsequent iterations are unstable.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
